        "cue": 1,
        "caption": "What if a demo video was not a recording you capture, but a value you compile? This is DemoCreate.",
        "seek_seconds": 3.244
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/candidate-0.8.0/cue-02.png",
        "sha256": "63bb3e45f46afe6872e2029214acb80096126bf13d96d22daa2d7b8418b6be60",
        "cue": 3,
        "caption": "A demo is a declarative spine: scenes of narration chunks, each an ordered stream of typed actions. Three ideas carry the whole system.",
        "seek_seconds": 22.3185
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/candidate-0.8.0/cue-05.png",
        "sha256": "47eefa9052ed39dbeb25040eb868708321760ee550f56f07160c96fe38896aed",
        "cue": 6,
        "caption": "Clip duration is measured. Word timing is estimated: the default transcriber spreads known text across the clip by character length. It does not detect spoken word onsets.",
        "seek_seconds": 57.9435
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/candidate-0.8.0/cue-07.png",
        "sha256": "ff488a8e716a6bd4f9422546b2a56abe27db656f260d435ad719057e93c9c16d",
        "cue": 8,
        "caption": "YAML configuration selects themes, layout, resolution presets including four K, and encoding controls. Actual quality depends on input detail and encoding settings.",
        "seek_seconds": 76.5165
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/candidate-0.8.0/cue-10.png",
        "sha256": "2b09a233e42f7d7c52ad5bfc8f9c23416deaa8aef4232a4b85b72165859cefbc",
        "cue": 11,
        "caption": "Eight subsystems share a declarative spine. Narration, rendering and export also depend on configuration, assets and the selected runtime environment.",
        "seek_seconds": 112.3125
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/candidate-0.8.0/cue-14.png",
        "sha256": "0f95a3466b1dbbd357507ae7329ef5de26f25ef6659a31a846b476422d052b3d",
        "cue": 15,
        "caption": "Declarative. Deterministic. Dogfooded. This entire video was compiled by DemoCreate from one file. Edit it, re-render, and never record a take again.",
        "seek_seconds": 154.1945
      }
